# OpenShell fork lives here as a separate git repo; we don't track its contents.
openshell-fork/

.DS_Store

node_modules/
dist/
.cache/
.worktrees/
*.srl

# Local-only project context — agent/editor configs and internal docs.
# Not for the public repo. (docs/ is tracked/public; local artifacts live in .local/)
# Exception: .claude/skills/ holds versioned, on-demand agent procedures and IS tracked —
# everything else under .claude/ (settings, local config, agent-registry state, etc.) stays
# ignored. A whole-directory ignore can't be negated per-child, hence the .claude/* + negation
# form rather than a bare `!.claude/skills/`.
# Exception: .claude/deliver.config.yaml is the tracked sidekick/deliver adapter config
# (gate + hard rules), also negated individually below.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/deliver.config.yaml
.mcp.json
.local/
